src/camera_table.rs (lane SMB-DEVELOP-CAMERA-COLOUR) is generated by
tools/camera-matrix-table.py from data of rawtoaces-data
(https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/rawtoaces-data, commit
e9b8503cf8a0641f40e5345d9757bde60c15f423): the camera spectral sensitivities
(data/camera/*.json, created by their listed document creators), the CIE 1931
colour matching functions (data/cmf/cmf_1931.json), the 190 training
reflectances (data/training/training_spectral.json) and the alias list
(data/aliases.json). The table holds matrices fitted to those data by the
tool, not the data themselves. The tool's CIE daylight basis (S0, S1, S2 at
10 nm) is copied from rawtoaces src/rawtoaces_core/define.h
(https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/rawtoaces, commit
ae8ad1fc75d48475fe58269b482ee3281f5d87fd), "Copyright Contributors to the
rawtoaces Project". Both are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0); no NOTICE file is distributed
with either. Modifications: matrices derived by the Handshake Studio
